      "box": [
        32.710655212402344,
        174.67491149902344,
        453.2520751953125,
        217.86607360839844
      ],
      "text": "in the whole process. Second, sugar cane get harvested by the means of two ways, either manually\nor using specialized vehicles. Third, the harvested sugar cane go through the step of crushing,\nresulting in liquid form called juice.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        31.729326248168945,
        224.0680389404297,
        450.8117980957031,
        241.42202758789062
      ],
      "text": "The fourth step involves purifying the juice through Limestone filters. The purified juice now goes\n"
    },
