      "box": [
        31.729310989379883,
        240.42335510253906,
        459.3166198730469,
        298.6617431640625
      ],
      "text": "through the fifth step, which put it under extreme heat to allow it to evaporate to get syrup out\nfrom it. Then the syrup is centrifuged to separate sugar crystals from syrup. Once that happend\nthe sugar is taken into the last phase of drying and cooling, which finalise the process and produce\nready-to-use sugar that is packed and ready for sale.\n"
